<title>USA: Clinton Gas to merge with Enron affiliate.</title>
<headline>Clinton Gas to merge with Enron affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clinton Gas Systems Inc said on Monday it would merge with an affiliate of Enron Corp's Enron Capital &amp; Trade Resources Corp in a $38 million deal.</p>
<p>The company said its shareholders overwhelming approved the proposed merger with Joint Energy Development Investments LP at a special meeting August 22.</p>
<p>It said the Enron affiliate would buy about 97 percent of its common stock at $6.75 cash per share when the merger closes early in the week of September 3.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
